  {
    "start": "00:03:13.050",
    "end": "00:03:14.400",
    "start_seconds": 193.05,
    "end_seconds": 194.4,
    "text": "There's a substance in this world"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:14.400",
    "end": "00:03:15.870",
    "start_seconds": 194.4,
    "end_seconds": 195.87,
    "text": "that's basically in every food,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:15.870",
    "end": "00:03:17.250",
    "start_seconds": 195.87,
    "end_seconds": 197.25,
    "text": "as far as I can tell, that will"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:17.250",
    "end": "00:03:19.140",
    "start_seconds": 197.25,
    "end_seconds": 199.14,
    "text": "kill my daughter if she eats it."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:19.230",
    "end": "00:03:20.910",
    "start_seconds": 199.23,
    "end_seconds": 200.91,
    "text": "So could you please just fucking"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:21.120",
    "end": "00:03:22.710",
    "start_seconds": 201.12,
    "end_seconds": 202.71,
    "text": "put peanuts on the order?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:22.710",
    "end": "00:03:23.700",
    "start_seconds": 202.71,
    "end_seconds": 203.7,
    "text": "But I don't do that because"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:23.700",
    "end": "00:03:24.990",
    "start_seconds": 203.7,
    "end_seconds": 204.99,
    "text": "I'm a better person than that."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:25.320",
    "end": "00:03:26.940",
    "start_seconds": 205.32,
    "end_seconds": 206.94,
    "text": "So I charge past her."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:26.940",
    "end": "00:03:28.230",
    "start_seconds": 206.94,
    "end_seconds": 208.23,
    "text": "I go past the counter and"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:28.230",
    "end": "00:03:29.640",
    "start_seconds": 208.23,
    "end_seconds": 209.64,
    "text": "into the employee area."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:29.760",
    "end": "00:03:31.620",
    "start_seconds": 209.76,
    "end_seconds": 211.62,
    "text": "I take two steps into the kitchen"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:31.740",
    "end": "00:03:33.240",
    "start_seconds": 211.74,
    "end_seconds": 213.24,
    "text": "and I go, listen, I, you're"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:33.240",
    "end": "00:03:34.560",
    "start_seconds": 213.24,
    "end_seconds": 214.56,
    "text": "gonna make a grilled cheese."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:34.560",
    "end": "00:03:35.670",
    "start_seconds": 214.56,
    "end_seconds": 215.67000000000002,
    "text": "And when you do, and then the"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:35.670",
    "end": "00:03:36.395",
    "start_seconds": 215.67000000000002,
    "end_seconds": 216.395,
    "text": "manager's right in front of me."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:37.095",
    "end": "00:03:38.385",
    "start_seconds": 217.095,
    "end_seconds": 218.385,
    "text": "And she says, sir, and I say,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:38.385",
    "end": "00:03:39.825",
    "start_seconds": 218.385,
    "end_seconds": 219.825,
    "text": "no, you don't understand."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:39.825",
    "end": "00:03:40.725",
    "start_seconds": 219.825,
    "end_seconds": 220.725,
    "text": "Your cashier will not"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:40.725",
    "end": "00:03:42.075",
    "start_seconds": 220.725,
    "end_seconds": 222.075,
    "text": "put peanuts on the order."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:42.075",
    "end": "00:03:43.215",
    "start_seconds": 222.075,
    "end_seconds": 223.215,
    "text": "And my daughter's allergic"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:43.245",
    "end": "00:03:44.625",
    "start_seconds": 223.245,
    "end_seconds": 224.625,
    "text": "and she's not gonna die today."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:44.625",
    "end": "00:03:46.875",
    "start_seconds": 224.625,
    "end_seconds": 226.875,
    "text": "And the manager to her Everlasting credit"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:47.325",
    "end": "00:03:50.715",
    "start_seconds": 227.325,
    "end_seconds": 230.715,
    "text": "softens, and she says, sir, I understand"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:50.775",
    "end": "00:03:52.095",
    "start_seconds": 230.775,
    "end_seconds": 232.095,
    "text": "and I will take care of it, but you"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:52.095",
    "end": "00:03:54.285",
    "start_seconds": 232.095,
    "end_seconds": 234.285,
    "text": "need to get out of my kitchen right now."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:54.615",
    "end": "00:03:55.305",
    "start_seconds": 234.615,
    "end_seconds": 235.305,
    "text": "And she's right."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:55.305",
    "end": "00:03:56.115",
    "start_seconds": 235.305,
    "end_seconds": 236.115,
    "text": "I'm crazy."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:56.115",
    "end": "00:03:57.525",
    "start_seconds": 236.115,
    "end_seconds": 237.525,
    "text": "And the kids have made me crazy."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:57.735",
    "end": "00:03:59.085",
    "start_seconds": 237.735,
    "end_seconds": 239.085,
    "text": "My wife has made me crazy."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:59.415",
    "end": "00:04:00.615",
    "start_seconds": 239.415,
    "end_seconds": 240.615,
    "text": "I get outta the kitchen,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:01.335",
    "end": "00:04:02.475",
    "start_seconds": 241.335,
    "end_seconds": 242.475,
    "text": "she finishes my order."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:02.475",
    "end": "00:04:04.035",
    "start_seconds": 242.475,
    "end_seconds": 244.035,
    "text": "I go to the dining room to find my"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:04.035",
    "end": "00:04:06.045",
    "start_seconds": 244.035,
    "end_seconds": 246.045,
    "text": "kids, and I cannot believe what I see."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:06.405",
    "end": "00:04:07.935",
    "start_seconds": 246.405,
    "end_seconds": 247.935,
    "text": "They have chosen a booth in the back."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:07.935",
    "end": "00:04:09.945",
    "start_seconds": 247.935,
    "end_seconds": 249.945,
    "text": "Clara is on one side, Charlie is on the"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:09.945",
    "end": "00:04:12.915",
    "start_seconds": 249.945,
    "end_seconds": 252.915,
    "text": "other side and in between there is a woman"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:12.915",
    "end": "00:04:15.165",
    "start_seconds": 252.915,
    "end_seconds": 255.165,
    "text": "who I do not recognize and an infant."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:15.464",
    "end": "00:04:17.445",
    "start_seconds": 255.464,
    "end_seconds": 257.445,
    "text": "They're sitting with strangers"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:20.115",
    "end": "00:04:21.615",
    "start_seconds": 260.115,
    "end_seconds": 261.615,
    "text": "and I'm thinking, how am I"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:21.615",
    "end": "00:04:23.355",
    "start_seconds": 261.615,
    "end_seconds": 263.355,
    "text": "going to solve this problem?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:23.355",
    "end": "00:04:25.185",
    "start_seconds": 263.355,
    "end_seconds": 265.185,
    "text": "But Clara knows what I'm gonna do"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:25.185",
    "end": "00:04:26.925",
    "start_seconds": 265.185,
    "end_seconds": 266.925,
    "text": "because she says, it's okay, dad."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:27.075",
    "end": "00:04:27.974",
    "start_seconds": 267.075,
    "end_seconds": 267.974,
    "text": "She said, we can sit"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:27.974",
    "end": "00:04:28.905",
    "start_seconds": 267.974,
    "end_seconds": 268.905,
    "text": "with them and have lunch."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:28.905",
    "end": "00:04:29.925",
    "start_seconds": 268.905,
    "end_seconds": 269.925,
    "text": "This is Hannah, and she"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:29.925",
    "end": "00:04:30.914",
    "start_seconds": 269.925,
    "end_seconds": 270.914,
    "text": "points to the infant."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:32.715",
    "end": "00:04:33.554",
    "start_seconds": 272.71500000000003,
    "end_seconds": 273.554,
    "text": "And so I look at the"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:33.554",
    "end": "00:04:34.844",
    "start_seconds": 273.554,
    "end_seconds": 274.844,
    "text": "woman and she looks at me."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:34.844",
    "end": "00:04:36.554",
    "start_seconds": 274.844,
    "end_seconds": 276.554,
    "text": "She gives me that sign that, I know"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:36.554",
    "end": "00:04:38.354",
    "start_seconds": 276.554,
    "end_seconds": 278.354,
    "text": "this is ridiculous, but let's do this."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:38.685",
    "end": "00:04:40.755",
    "start_seconds": 278.685,
    "end_seconds": 280.755,
    "text": "And so I sit down with a stranger"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:40.755",
    "end": "00:04:44.265",
    "start_seconds": 280.755,
    "end_seconds": 284.265,
    "text": "at Panera, and Clara introduces me"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:44.265",
    "end": "00:04:46.094",
    "start_seconds": 284.265,
    "end_seconds": 286.094,
    "text": "to them, and we make some chitchat."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:46.395",
    "end": "00:04:47.685",
    "start_seconds": 286.395,
    "end_seconds": 287.685,
    "text": "And then she asks the woman, she"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:47.685",
    "end": "00:04:49.424",
    "start_seconds": 287.685,
    "end_seconds": 289.424,
    "text": "says, where's Hannah's daddy today?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:49.424",
    "end": "00:04:50.385",
    "start_seconds": 289.424,
    "end_seconds": 290.385,
    "text": "And the woman says, oh,"
  },
