    "start": "00:04:50.414",
    "end": "00:04:51.705",
    "start_seconds": 290.414,
    "end_seconds": 291.705,
    "text": "Hannah doesn't have a daddy."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:52.094",
    "end": "00:04:52.695",
    "start_seconds": 292.094,
    "end_seconds": 292.695,
    "text": "And my wife."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:52.695",
    "end": "00:04:54.734",
    "start_seconds": 292.695,
    "end_seconds": 294.734,
    "text": "And, and Clara says, oh, is it,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:54.794",
    "end": "00:04:56.414",
    "start_seconds": 294.794,
    "end_seconds": 296.414,
    "text": "are you a mommy, mommy family?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:56.745",
    "end": "00:04:59.505",
    "start_seconds": 296.745,
    "end_seconds": 299.505,
    "text": "And she says, no, it's just Hannah and me."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:00.525",
    "end": "00:05:02.055",
    "start_seconds": 300.525,
    "end_seconds": 302.055,
    "text": "That's the moment when I look at this"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:02.055",
    "end": "00:05:03.855",
    "start_seconds": 302.055,
    "end_seconds": 303.855,
    "text": "woman for the first time and I really"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:03.855",
    "end": "00:05:06.795",
    "start_seconds": 303.855,
    "end_seconds": 306.795,
    "text": "see her and I see the bags under her eyes"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:06.795",
    "end": "00:05:08.595",
    "start_seconds": 306.795,
    "end_seconds": 308.595,
    "text": "and the slumping shoulders, and I see"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:08.595",
    "end": "00:05:11.145",
    "start_seconds": 308.595,
    "end_seconds": 311.145,
    "text": "the, the stuff that she has everywhere."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:11.145",
    "end": "00:05:12.705",
    "start_seconds": 311.145,
    "end_seconds": 312.705,
    "text": "She's got the stroller and the"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:12.705",
    "end": "00:05:14.775",
    "start_seconds": 312.705,
    "end_seconds": 314.775,
    "text": "car seat and the diapers and all"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:14.775",
    "end": "00:05:16.515",
    "start_seconds": 314.775,
    "end_seconds": 316.515,
    "text": "the plastic paraphernalia that"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:16.515",
    "end": "00:05:18.165",
    "start_seconds": 316.515,
    "end_seconds": 318.165,
    "text": "we need to keep kids alive today."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:18.165",
    "end": "00:05:20.715",
    "start_seconds": 318.165,
    "end_seconds": 320.715,
    "text": "The pacifiers and the bottles."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:20.715",
    "end": "00:05:22.935",
    "start_seconds": 320.715,
    "end_seconds": 322.935,
    "text": "All stuff that I haven't seen in a"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:22.935",
    "end": "00:05:24.885",
    "start_seconds": 322.935,
    "end_seconds": 324.885,
    "text": "little while because my kids are older."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:25.305",
    "end": "00:05:26.055",
    "start_seconds": 325.305,
    "end_seconds": 326.055,
    "text": "It's the first time I"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:26.055",
    "end": "00:05:27.795",
    "start_seconds": 326.055,
    "end_seconds": 327.795,
    "text": "really see this woman."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:28.155",
    "end": "00:05:29.895",
    "start_seconds": 328.155,
    "end_seconds": 329.895,
    "text": "Who's taking care of this baby and"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:29.985",
    "end": "00:05:33.525",
    "start_seconds": 329.985,
    "end_seconds": 333.525,
    "text": "all of this stuff by herself and."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:34.170",
    "end": "00:05:36.420",
    "start_seconds": 334.17,
    "end_seconds": 336.42,
    "text": "I'm so angry at Clara because she"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:36.420",
    "end": "00:05:38.370",
    "start_seconds": 336.42,
    "end_seconds": 338.37,
    "text": "has shown me the thing that I need"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:38.370",
    "end": "00:05:40.620",
    "start_seconds": 338.37,
    "end_seconds": 340.62,
    "text": "to see in this moment that I'm"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:40.620",
    "end": "00:05:42.210",
    "start_seconds": 340.62,
    "end_seconds": 342.21,
    "text": "wandering this world complaining."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:42.210",
    "end": "00:05:43.860",
    "start_seconds": 342.21,
    "end_seconds": 343.86,
    "text": "'cause my wife left with me, with my"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:43.860",
    "end": "00:05:47.460",
    "start_seconds": 343.86,
    "end_seconds": 347.46,
    "text": "kids for three hours, three stupid"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:47.490",
    "end": "00:05:50.160",
    "start_seconds": 347.49,
    "end_seconds": 350.15999999999997,
    "text": "hours that I am complaining about."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:50.430",
    "end": "00:05:52.200",
    "start_seconds": 350.43,
    "end_seconds": 352.2,
    "text": "I remember when Clara was born, I thought"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:52.200",
    "end": "00:05:54.840",
    "start_seconds": 352.2,
    "end_seconds": 354.84000000000003,
    "text": "we needed seven adults to keep her alive."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:55.560",
    "end": "00:05:57.540",
    "start_seconds": 355.56,
    "end_seconds": 357.54,
    "text": "And this woman is doing it"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:57.540",
    "end": "00:06:00.150",
    "start_seconds": 357.54,
    "end_seconds": 360.15,
    "text": "on her own and she's smiling."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:00.705",
    "end": "00:06:02.955",
    "start_seconds": 360.705,
    "end_seconds": 362.955,
    "text": "She's chatting with my daughter in a way."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:02.955",
    "end": "00:06:06.135",
    "start_seconds": 362.955,
    "end_seconds": 366.135,
    "text": "I have not chatted with her all day, and"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:06.135",
    "end": "00:06:10.335",
    "start_seconds": 366.135,
    "end_seconds": 370.335,
    "text": "I sit there with these two brilliant beams"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:10.335",
    "end": "00:06:13.815",
    "start_seconds": 370.335,
    "end_seconds": 373.815,
    "text": "of light knowing I am never going to be"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:14.325",
    "end": "00:06:17.025",
    "start_seconds": 374.325,
    "end_seconds": 377.025,
    "text": "as beautiful and as wonderful as they are."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:17.475",
    "end": "00:06:17.865",
    "start_seconds": 377.475,
    "end_seconds": 377.865,
    "text": "Thank you."
  }
]
